This directory vendors files from anthropics/fermats-last-theorem (https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem),
commit 6e837e75355538c7f80bab5b956861e86c4eacc2, Copyright 2026 Anthropic, PBC, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (LICENSE). That repository's own notices are reproduced byte for byte in NOTICE.upstream and
ATTRIBUTION.upstream.md; the per-file attributions listed in ATTRIBUTION.upstream.md apply to the corresponding files
here.

Modifications: the files are ported to Lean 4.35 / Mathlib 56a0058. Import paths are relocated (upstream modules
already vendored elsewhere in this kernel are imported from that copy rather than duplicated); the upstream lakefile
options are set as `set_option` lines after the imports; the upstream proof-wrapper utility (`P2M.Util`) is not
imported, its commands being replaced by ordinary Lean (`open`, `open scoped`, `export`, `alias`, and `revert`/`exact`
of the paired proof); the generated blanket `attribute [-instance]` / `attribute [-simp]` lists are removed; local
notations are expanded to their terms; any other change is marked `-- [port]`. The root solution file states the
upstream conclusion without its irreducibility conjunct (marked there). SOURCE_MANIFEST.json records, per file, the
upstream module, git blob SHA-1 and SHA-256, and the SHA-256 of the vendored file.
